### 流式聊天：响应为text/event-stream;charset=UTF-8，每个data事件是一段UTF-8文本。
POST http://localhost:8105/api/ai/streamChat
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: text/event-stream

{
  "userId": "930000000000000001",
  "sessionId": "930000000000000099",
  "prompt": "请分三点介绍项目中的聊天记录搜索。"
}

### 同一会话读取上一轮记忆；普通接口仍返回一次性JSON。
POST http://localhost:8105/api/ai/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "930000000000000001",
  "sessionId": "930000000000000099",
  "prompt": "请简短概括你刚才的回答。"
}
